## SQLite Setup

The SQLite database file (`test.db` by default, ignored by Git) is created automatically the first time the app connects. Its **schema**, however, is managed by versioned migration files under `migrations/` (via [golang-migrate](https://github.com/golang-migrate/migrate)) rather than being created when the app boots.

Create the schema **before** running the app:

```text
$ make migrate-up
```

Roll back the most recent migration with `make migrate-down`, and scaffold a new pair with `make migrate-create name=<change>` (e.g. `make migrate-create name=add_email`).
